# _JumpToContinuation (78B238CC) ends with `jmp eax`: restore the owning
# frame's ebp/esp from the registration node and continue at the __except
# or __finally block. Abandons the call chain (GuestResume).
resume 78B238F7

# CRT SEH: __SEH_prolog4 and __SEH_prolog4_GS set up a frame whose __except
# handler returns through __SEH_epilog4 to the function's own caller, not to
# the host call site. The lifter marks their callers, and every call to such
# a function catches GuestReturn.
seh_prolog 78AB0950
seh_prolog 78AB07B0
# The epilog restores the frame and returns non-locally (src/seh_native.cpp).
replace 78AB0995 __seh_epilog4
